### Get CRM Catalog
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/integrations/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get Current Integration
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/integrations
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Save App Info and Grants
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/integrations/uysot
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "appName": "Uysot Voice Platform",
  "grants": [
    {
      "permission": "LEAD",
      "scope": "SAVE"
    },
    {
      "permission": "CALL",
      "scope": "SAVE"
    }
  ]
}

### Connect amoCRM / Kommo (token of the account's private integration)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/integrations/account
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "provider": "AMOCRM",
  "baseUrl": "acme.amocrm.ru",
  "accessToken": "{{amocrm_long_lived_token}}"
}

### Connect Bitrix24 (inbound webhook — the URL is the credential)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/integrations/account
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "provider": "BITRIX24",
  "baseUrl": "{{bitrix24_webhook_url}}"
}

### Get Authorize URL
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/integrations/uysot/authorize-url
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Disconnect Integration
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/settings/integrations/uysot
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
